# Web3Forms access key for the contact form.
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter your email to get a free access key.
# 2. Copy this file to ".env" and paste your key below.
# 3. Restart the dev server. The form will then send real emails to you.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
